  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>x</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mi>a</mi> <mi>x</mi> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mi>a</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </mrow></math><math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0000204_AnsExp1_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 309px;\" /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo></mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mi>a</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> <msqrt> <mn>5</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mi>a</mi> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>3</mn> <msqrt> <mn>5</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn>&nbsp; </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; ....(i)<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo></mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>8</mn> <mi>a</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or &nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mspace></mspace> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mi>a</mi> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt></mrow></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;....(ii)<br /><br />and&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>·</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo></mrow></math>&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>8</mn> <mi>a</mi> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mrow><mo>-</mo> <mn>8</mn> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mi>a</mi> <mo>&lt;</mo> <mn>0 </mn> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....(iii)<br /><br />From Eqs. (i), (ii) and (iii), we get,<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> <msqrt> <mn>5</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>≤</mo> <mi>a</mi> <mo>≤</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Hence, integral values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> are&nbsp; <math><mrow><mo>-</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mi>,</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>5</mn> <mi>,</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mi>,</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mi>,</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mi>,</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Required Sum<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>91</mn></math>.",
